# Files and directories that must not ship in the release ZIP.
#
# Paths starting with "/" are anchored to the plugin root. That matters:
# rsync matches an unanchored name at any depth, so a bare "vendor" would
# also strip lib/plugin-update-checker/vendor, which the updater needs at
# runtime to render the update details.
/.github
/.distignore
/package.json
/package-lock.json
/composer.json
/composer.lock
/phpcs.xml
/phpcs.xml.dist
/phpunit.xml
/phpunit.xml.dist
/tests
/docs
/build
/vendor
# Internal notes. readme.txt is what the plugin screen reads.
/README.md
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
node_modules
*.zip
*.log
